          "title": "13.8. Uniform Manifold Approximation and Projection (UMAP): Teori Topologi Aljabar",
          "orderIndex": 8,
          "description": "Terobosan Leland McInnes et al. (2018): pemodelan manifold melalui kompleks simplisial fuzzy (Fuzzy Simplicial Sets) dan optimasi Cross-Entropy.",
